    "brandNote": {
      "maxH": 900,
      "page": "brand",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "HCIG in the picture, B and D\n\nYour ask: show who we are in the image itself, like the original and J.\n\nB 1 Beacon: the HC mark sits where the flows meet, over Egypt, and pulses.\nB 2 Network: the HC mark drawn as points and links on the Earth, drawing itself in.\nB 3 Watermark: a large faint HC mark in space, like the original.\n\nD 1 The full HCIG logo etched into the boardroom window.\nD 2 The HC mark alone, etched larger in the window.\nD 3 A large faint HC mark over the window.\n\nReal logo files only, never redrawn. Each works by night and by day (press the sun). Pick one per hero, or say mix.",
      "w": 460,
      "x": 3560,
      "y": 0
    },
    "filmGroup": {
      "x": 0,
