      "x": 4040,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 460,
      "maxH": 900,
      "size": "m",
      "fill": "yellow",
      "page": "film",
      "text": "The group film, new boards\n\n1. Hero B with the film: a copy of B where the 30 second film loops in the picture, on the right where the flows meet. B and its watermark stay on the other pages as they were.\n2. Group section: the full film, with a sound button, and the eight brands under it. On phones the tall cut fills the width.\n\nPress Play on a board to see the film move. Nothing on the other pages was changed."
    },
