    "finalNote": {
      "x": 4040,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 460,
      "maxH": 1100,
      "size": "m",
      "fill": "yellow",
      "page": "final",
      "text": "The final page, my picks\n\n1. Hero: B, the Earth at night with the light flows. The group film plays in the picture where the flows meet, so HCIG and its eight brands are in the image itself.\n2. Below it: the group section, the full 30 second film with a sound button and the eight brands.\n3. One switch: the sun or the moon in the header turns the whole page, hero and section together.\n4. Brand colours only: Black, Dim Gray, Turquoise, White. At night the accent words are Turquoise; by day they are Black with a Turquoise line.\n5. Phones first: the photo strip melts into the page with no seam when you switch.\n\nThe four heroes, the film boards and the twelve stay on their pages."
    },
